hey friends et's resident lifestyle  expert here and you know what else is  here summer now you know i've got your  back when it comes to the latest and  greatest food trends and now i'm serving  up one super healthy super simple super  delish and super instagramable breakfast  that will fill you with all the  nutritious goodness you need before  having fun in the sun  drum roll please  the spirulina granola bowl  not only is it totally gorge it's also  vegan using planet oat unsweetened  original oat milk which has zero grams  of sugar and a richness that is just  so you know this is gonna be good here's  what you'll need to get this healthy  bowl in your belly starting with the  granola three and a half cups rolled  oats one cup raw unsalted shaved almonds  half a cup salted roasted pumpkin seeds  half cup flax seeds a fourth cup agave  nectar a fourth cup maple syrup half a  cup coconut oil a pinch of salt one  teaspoon vanilla extract and one  teaspoon cinnamon  preheat your oven to 275 degrees and  while that's warming up throw all your  ingredients into a big bowl and stir it  up so that everything is coated  extra points if you turn up the music  and dance while you do it  seriously i wish you guys could smell  this it's like a  cinnamon dream come true  anyway line a rimmed baking sheet with  parchment paper spread the mixture into  a single layer and bake until it's  toasted and dry but not burnt this will  take about 45 minutes to an hour so i  recommend giving it a good toss about  every 15 minutes  once it's done take it out of the oven  and let it fully cool now here's the fun  part combine four teaspoons of blue  spirulina powder with four cups plan it  out unsweetened original oat milk stir  and watch it turn into a rich dark royal  blue now pour that oat milk magic over  your granola in a bowl top with your  favorite fruit add some shredded coconut  and voila the perfect summer breakfast  [Music]
 

